{"id":"n45157-5-7","stage":1,"title":"깊다 · 浓","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n45157-5-7-1","ko":"오늘은 대중교통으로 회사에 오시는군요.","zh":"今天您是坐公共交通工具来公司的啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘은","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘은","audio":"/audio/45021ad1ec5b4083b856.mp3"}},{"text":"대중교통으로","meaning":"公共交通，大众交通","explanation":"대중교통：公共交通，大众交通；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"대중교통","audio":"/audio/798edec3387c548bd528.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"47546","senseId":"1","lemma":"대중교통","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"대중교통으로","audio":"/audio/cf0e9119201f75234305.mp3"}},{"text":"회사에","meaning":"公司，企业，会社","explanation":"회사：公司，企业，会社；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"회사","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31668","senseId":"1","lemma":"회사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"회사에","audio":"/audio/b40802e07b0e88855c61.mp3"}},{"text":"오시는군요.","meaning":"来，来参加","explanation":"오다：来，来参加；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体；는군요：对新发现或新理解的情况表示礼貌的感叹。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"12","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오시는군요","audio":"/audio/43faca243a9d28e294be.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"798edec3387c548b","term":"대중교통","zh":"公共交通，大众交通","audio":"/audio/798edec3387c548bd528.mp3","entryId":"47546","definition":"如公交车或地铁等供多人使用的交通；或指交通手段。","pronunciation":["대ː중교통"]},{"id":"a109dcd7f6f11c2e","term":"회사","zh":"公司，企业，会社","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3","entryId":"31668","definition":"想要通过事业获得利益的许多人一起建立的法人团体。","pronunciation":["회ː사","훼ː사"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，来参加","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"为了参与某个有目的性的聚会而从另一个地方转移到这个地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/960f1fc3c7e899ddd93c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n45157-5-7-2","ko":"안개가 깊어서 앞이 안 보이니 운전을 못 하겠더라고요.","zh":"因为雾太浓，看不清前方，所以没法开车。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"안개가","meaning":"雾，雾气","explanation":"안개：雾，雾气；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"안개","audio":"/audio/b70164aa8123e15aa7fa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14777","senseId":"1","lemma":"안개","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안개가","audio":"/audio/e809f614c09c5ca62579.mp3"}},{"text":"깊어서","meaning":"浓","explanation":"깊다：浓；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"깊다","audio":"/audio/89e1deb137581102f2b2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"45157","senseId":"5","lemma":"깊다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"깊어서","audio":"/audio/ba3ec7262144427b3023.mp3"}},{"text":"앞이","meaning":"前，前面","explanation":"앞：前，前面；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"앞","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88648","senseId":"1","lemma":"앞","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"앞이","audio":"/audio/c74b78ad5b87526d4712.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"보이니","meaning":"看起来，看上去","explanation":"보이다：看起来，看上去；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","senseId":"4","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보이니","audio":"/audio/ef81d90c5f513f5194d9.mp3"}},{"text":"운전을","meaning":"驾驶，操纵，开","explanation":"운전：驾驶，操纵，开；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"운전","audio":"/audio/5d97578a4a83b40e2ef4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69304","senseId":"1","lemma":"운전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"운전을","audio":"/audio/ae1dfd00e0d12efed441.mp3"}},{"text":"못","meaning":"不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","explanation":"못：不能、没能（能力或条件限制）。","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}},{"text":"하겠더라고요.","meaning":"做、进行（운전을 하다：开车）","explanation":"하다：做、进行（운전을 하다：开车）；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；더라고：回顾并告诉对方亲身观察到的情况，非敬语；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하겠더라고요","audio":"/audio/583e09d24ea58584f016.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"b70164aa8123e15a","term":"안개","zh":"雾，雾气","audio":"/audio/b70164aa8123e15aa7fa.mp3","entryId":"14777","definition":"接近地面的水蒸气，遇冷凝结后飘浮在空气中的小水点。","pronunciation":["안ː개"]},{"id":"89e1deb137581102","term":"깊다","zh":"浓","audio":"/audio/89e1deb137581102f2b2.mp3","entryId":"45157","definition":"由于黑暗、雾气等原因，导致看到的对象很黑或很朦胧。","pronunciation":["깁따"]},{"id":"ec1a6b96ce688b70","term":"앞","zh":"前，前面","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3","entryId":"88648","definition":"所向的一面或地方。","pronunciation":["압"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"da6f27438e6f345c","term":"보이다","zh":"看起来，看上去","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3","entryId":"62091","definition":"认为或判断出某对象怎样。","pronunciation":["보이다"]},{"id":"5d97578a4a83b40e","term":"운전","zh":"驾驶，操纵，开","audio":"/audio/5d97578a4a83b40e2ef4.mp3","entryId":"69304"